        "text_6X8y3H": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This next chapter of Candles By Victoria is rooted in both legacy and love. We're sisters who share a deep bond and a strong work ethic that has always brought us closer together. We’ve always worked side by side, and are incredibly in tune with each other — in how we work, how we dream, and how we care for the things we build. Candles by Victoria is something we are pouring our whole hearts into, and we are grateful every day for the chance to carry this legacy forward together.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>For over 26 years, Victoria poured her heart into every candle she created. Through her passion and dedication, she built something truly special — a loyal community of over 58,000 candle lovers who have made CBV much more than just a business. It’s a family.</p><p></p><p>We can assure you, we see that. We feel that. And we deeply respect it!</p><p><br/><strong>Our promise to you is simple:</strong></p><p><strong>* We are keeping the name — Candles by Victoria will live on.<br/>* We are keeping the recipes — every scent, every note, every comforting memory you know and love.<br/>* We may refresh the jars and look over time, but never the heart of what makes these candles special. </strong></p><p></p><p></p><p>We know no one could ever replace Victoria — and that’s not our intention. Our goal is to honor what she built while caring for this community the same way she did: with honesty, dedication, and love for every candle that leaves our door.</p><p>From our family to yours, thank you for welcoming us into this next chapter.</p><p><br/>With warmth and gratitude,</p><p><br/>Nikki & Rikki<br/>Candles By Victoria<br/>1999–Present — Continuing the Legacy</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
